--- README.md ---
# Repot export

Generated by Repot 0.1.0 on 2026-11-02 10:00 UTC

Source: macOS -> Target: Windows

Review these files before restoring. Install the required package and version managers first.

## Restore

### winget.json

```powershell
winget import -i winget.json --accept-package-agreements --accept-source-agreements
```

### scoop.json

```powershell
scoop import scoop.json
```

### choco-packages.config

```powershell
# Run in an Administrator PowerShell
choco install choco-packages.config -y
```

Secret detection is pattern-based and may not catch every secret. Review all files before sharing.
